{
  "declaredLength": 11020,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "¡Hay que tener un rival en la vida!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10048006100790020007100750065002000740065006E0065007200200075006E00200072006900760061006C00200065006E0020006C006100200076006900640061002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Opino lo mismo!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004F00700069006E006F0020006C006F0020006D00690073006D006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Estás seguro?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00450073007400E10073002000730065006700750072006F003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¿Verdad que sí?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100BF00560065007200640061006400200071007500650020007300ED003F002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Claro que sí!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006C00610072006F00200071007500650020007300ED002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Y quiero que tú seas mi rival!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10059002000710075006900650072006F00200071007500650020007400FA002000730065006100730020006D006900200072006900760061006C002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Entiendo que te confunda la propuesta, ¡pero\ndéjame que te lo explique con una historia!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Había una vez dos Entrenadores que nacieron el\nmismo día y eligieron de compañero a Charcadet.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Charcadet puede evolucionar a dos Pokémon\ndistintos según el objeto que se use.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero no puede ser eternamente un Charcadet,\ndel mismo modo que dos rivales no pueden<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nseguir por siempre un mismo camino.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 128
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Al separarse, ¡uno de ellos haría evolucionar\nal suyo a Armarouge y, el otro, a Ceruledge!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hasta que, un buen día, ambos Entrenadores\n(que somos tú y yo, por si no te diste cuenta)...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Se reencontraron dispuestos a tener un duelo\nfinal para decidir quién era más fuerte:<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Armarouge o Ceruledge, la luz o la oscuridad,\nel bien o el mal, la palta o el aguacate!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 182
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Apasionante, ¿no? Es lo que siempre soñé,\npero no tengo ninguna amistad que haya nacido<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nel mismo día que yo, y mucho menos alguien que<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nsea mi rival. ¡Por eso quiero que tú lo seas!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 191
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Te doy una pista! Para hacer que Charcadet\nevolucione necesitas una Armadura Auspiciosa o<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nuna Armadura Maldita.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 120
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Elige una y te la daré! ¡Evoluciona a Charcadet\ny haz realidad el combate de mis sueños!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 3176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Cuando hayas decidido qué armadura quieres,\navísame!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 3364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004300750061006E0064006F00200068006100790061007300200064006500630069006400690064006F00200071007500E9002000610072006D0061006400750072006100200071007500690065007200650073002C000A0061007600ED00730061006D0065002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 3480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Ya decidiste qué armadura quieres?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00590061002000640065006300690064006900730074006500200071007500E9002000610072006D0061006400750072006100200071007500690065007200650073003F00100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La Armadura Auspiciosa",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0061002000410072006D0061006400750072006100200041007500730070006900630069006F007300610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La Armadura Maldita",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0061002000410072006D006100640075007200610020004D0061006C00640069007400610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Todavía no decidí",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006F00640061007600ED00610020006E006F00200064006500630069006400ED0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Quiero tener el duelo de mis sueños contra ti!\n¡No decidas a la ligera!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Así que la Armadura Auspiciosa... Quieres que\ntu Charcadet evolucione a Armarouge.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En ese caso, yo usaré la Armadura Maldita y\nevolucionaré el mío a Ceruledge.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 4028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Adelante, Charcadet! ¡El poder de la llama azul\nes todo tuyo!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 4192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004100640065006C0061006E00740065002C00200043006800610072006300610064006500740021002000A10045006C00200070006F0064006500720020006400650020006C00610020006C006C0061006D006100200061007A0075006C000A0065007300200074006F0064006F0020007400750079006F002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Será un duelo entre tu Armarouge y mi\nCeruledge! ¡No vale usar otro Pokémon!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Leeedge!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004C00650065006500640067006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Así que la Armadura Maldita... Quieres que tu\nCharcadet evolucione a Ceruledge.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En ese caso, yo usaré la Armadura Auspiciosa y\nevolucionaré el mío a Armarouge.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Adelante, Charcadet! ¡El poder de la llama\ncarmesí es todo tuyo!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004100640065006C0061006E00740065002C00200043006800610072006300610064006500740021002000A10045006C00200070006F0064006500720020006400650020006C00610020006C006C0061006D0061000A006300610072006D0065007300ED00200065007300200074006F0064006F0020007400750079006F002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Será un duelo entre tu Ceruledge y mi\nArmarouge! ¡No vale usar otro Pokémon!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Rouuuge!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 5152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10052006F0075007500750067006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 5172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Quieres tener el duelo final entre Armarouge\ny Ceruledge?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 5184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0051007500690065007200650073002000740065006E0065007200200065006C0020006400750065006C006F002000660069006E0061006C00200065006E007400720065002000410072006D00610072006F007500670065000A007900200043006500720075006C0065006400670065003F00100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡En guardia!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10045006E0020006700750061007200640069006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Todavía no",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006F00640061007600ED00610020006E006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Dónde está el contraste si usamos el mismo?\n¡Tiene que ser Armarouge contra Ceruledge!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Entiendo. Mejor no tomar este duelo a la ligera.\nEsperaré a que estés list<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por fin llegó el día de poner a prueba la\nfuerza de Armarouge contra Ceruledge.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Es el duelo final que siempre soñé!\nMetámonos en el papel...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 149
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nunca imaginé que nos reencontraríamos en\nestas circunstancias.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 6024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E0075006E0063006100200069006D006100670069006E00E900200071007500650020006E006F00730020007200650065006E0063006F006E007400720061007200ED0061006D006F007300200065006E000A00650073007400610073002000630069007200630075006E007300740061006E0063006900610073002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hmm. Veo que decidiste hacer que tu Charcadet\nevolucionara a Armarouge.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 6152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006D006D002E002000560065006F0020007100750065002000640065006300690064006900730074006500200068006100630065007200200071007500650020007400750020004300680061007200630061006400650074000A00650076006F006C007500630069006F006E00610072006100200061002000410072006D00610072006F007500670065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Te acuerdas de nuestro primer duelo, el que\ntuvimos cuando aún eran Charcadet?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 6296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me acuerdo de que te gané",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 6456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00650020006100630075006500720064006F0020006400650020007100750065002000740065002000670061006E00E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me acuerdo de que ganaste",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 6508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00650020006100630075006500720064006F0020006400650020007100750065002000670061006E00610073007400650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Puede ser... pero ya no soy el mismo.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 6560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000750065006400650020007300650072002E002E002E0020007000650072006F0020007900610020006E006F00200073006F007900200065006C0020006D00690073006D006F002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Puede ser... pero seguro has mejorado\ndesde ese entonces.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000750065006400650020007300650072002E002E002E0020007000650072006F002000730065006700750072006F00200068006100730020006D0065006A006F007200610064006F000A00640065007300640065002000650073006500200065006E0074006F006E006300650073002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Este será el duelo definitivo... que culminará con\nla victoria de mi Ceruledge.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 6752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Adelante, Ceruledge. ¡Desata el poder de la llama\nazul!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 6912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100640065006C0061006E00740065002C00200043006500720075006C0065006400670065002E002000A100440065007300610074006100200065006C00200070006F0064006500720020006400650020006C00610020006C006C0061006D0061000A0061007A0075006C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Es un duelo entre tu Armarouge y mi\nCeruledge! ¡No vale usar otro Pokémon!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 7024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿2",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 7184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00320000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La llama azul se apaga... ¡Solo mi verdader<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa rival\npodía derrotar a mi Ceruledge!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 7196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La llama azul arde más viva que nunca.\nMi Ceruledge se llevó la victoria.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 7380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Gracias, estuvo increíble!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡El duelo que siempre soñé, como si\nrealmente fuéramos rivales predestinados!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
